desc: Convert camelCase to snake_case
category: ex
par: 16
hint1: Substitution with regex
hint2: \u matches uppercase in a pattern, \l lowercases in replacement
solution: :%s/\u/_\l&/g<CR>
note: \u matches an uppercase letter; replace with _ plus its lowercase (\l&). g = all per line.
--- START ---
camelCase
getUserName
processItem
doStuff
valueOf
--- GOAL ---
camel_case
get_user_name
process_item
do_stuff
value_of
--- END ---
